{"id":"5454","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5454_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-perlucidus-translucidus-cavum_clouds-special-clouds-and-other-features.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图为薄层高积云中的两个雨幡洞（云洞附加特征）（在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>可见）。这两个雨幡洞大致上呈圆形，但在此情况下，其边缘似乎略显破碎和模糊。它们逐渐扩在到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">几乎合为一体</span>，中间仅有一小块云将它们分开。在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">5</span>雨幡洞中心位置，可清晰地看到冰晶或雨幡的核心区域。</p>\n<p>一系列锋正在向东抵近，而高积云也在逐渐侵入天空，并通常在清晨时整体变厚。在拍摄照片之时，大范围的云层（层状云）<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">在云素之间有空隙（漏隙云）</span>，透光充分，可显露太阳的位置（透光云）。因此，整体类别属于云洞透光漏隙成层高积云。</p>\n<p>这些雨幡洞只是观测者所在位置2小时内看到的（至少17个）其中一些。同时进行的延时拍摄显示出一些飘过空中的雨幡洞，而卫星图像显示，在英国英格兰上空向东移动的薄云层中广泛出现雨幡洞。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© George Anderson","location":"英国，英格兰，沃金厄姆","latitude":"纬度: 51° 25' 4'' N","longitude":"经度: 0° 51' 48'' W","date":"08 November 2016 0926 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西西南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 5, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.4.16","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.4.16"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5454_syn_altocumulus-stratiformis-perlucidus-translucidus-cavum_clouds-special-clouds-and-other-features.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>一系列的锋正在向东抵近。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇家版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5454_sat_altocumulus-stratiformis-perlucidus-translucidus-cavum_clouds-special-clouds-and-other-features.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>Metop-A在1010 UTC的云图显示在大片的高积云中发展出一些雨幡洞。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2016","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/movie_play_blue.png","title":"","description":"","copyright":"","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":"","videoSrc":"/images/compressed/tlvid/5454_tlvid_altocumulus-stratiformis-perlucidus-translucidus-cavum_clouds-special-clouds-and-other-features.mp4"}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5167_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-perlucidus-translucidus-cavum_clouds-special-clouds-and-other-features.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>这个大范围的透光薄云层是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">透光成层高积云</span>。图片上部还显示出<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">漏隙</span>云类，因为云素之间有间隙。然而，最显著的特征是有一个巨大几乎圆形的洞，下方是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">雨幡</span>。这个大洞是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云洞</span>附加特征，通常称之为“雨幡洞云”或“穿洞云”。因此，云的完整分类是云洞透光漏隙成层高积云。</p>\n<p>另须注意的是在该云中，雨幡洞与地平线之间的线性空隙。这是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">飞机消散尾迹</span>，或消散尾迹，其形成是因为飞机穿越云层。有时非正式地将其称为“运河云”。随后它会变为一个圆形洞（参见附带的延时摄影）。</p>\n<p>云洞附加特征的形成条件是温度低于0°C液态过冷水滴构成的薄云层中出现冻结现象。由于过冷水滴冻结，所产生的冰晶从云层中下落至低空形成幡状或雨幡。其产生的云洞通常会逐渐变大，同时冻结过程持续。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Tsz Cheung Lee","location":"中国，香港，观塘","latitude":"纬度: 22° 18' 41'' N","longitude":"经度: 114° 13' 38'' E","date":"19 January 2015 0830 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.4.16","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.4.16"}]}]}